	\section{Introduction}
	LaTeX is a document preparation system based on the TeX typesetting system. It allows authors to focus on content rather than appearance.
	
	\subsection{Why Use LaTeX?}
	Unlike standard word processors, LaTeX handles document formatting automatically and maintains consistency across long technical papers.
	
	\subsubsection{Key Benefits}
	It is portable, free, and produces publication-quality output.
	
